Conventional Commits standard:

type(scope): description

Types allowed:
feat → new feature
fix → bug fix
docs → documentation
style → formatting
refactor → code restructure
test → adding tests
chore → maintenance
ci → pipeline changes
security → security fix

Examples:
feat(order-service): add circuit breaker
fix(auth): fix token expiry calculation
security(payment): patch CVE-2024-1234
ci(jenkins): add DAST stage

Blocked:
"fixed stuff" ← no type
"WIP" ← not descriptive
"asdfgh" ← meaningless
"test" ← too vague
